{
 "encounter_id": "00964",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
  "person_4": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good afternoon. Before we start, how would you prefer to be addressed, Mr Simmons, or Arthur? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mr Simmons will do nicely, thank you, doctor. I've brought my daughter and my carer. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'm Diane, his daughter. And this is Rosa, who's with him in the daytime. He's been having terrible headaches since he started the new spray."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you both. Mr Simmons, tell me about the headaches."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "They come within minutes of using it. A pounding across my forehead. It's been about two weeks, since the spray was started."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "He grips his head, doctor, and has to sit down for twenty minutes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you feel anything else when you use it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A flushed face. Very warm. I go quite red."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "I've seen it, he looks like a lobster. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And dizziness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A touch, when I stand after the spray."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Which spray is it, Diane?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "The nitroglycerin spray, 0.4 mg, under the tongue, when he gets chest tightness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what else does he take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "An aspirin, 81 mg, every morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies, Mr Simmons?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sulfa drugs. I came out in a rash."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. And your medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Angina, high blood pressure, and gout."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Who do you live with?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I live with Diane and her husband."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Blood pressure 132 over 78, pulse 70.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is that normal? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good for his age. Mr Simmons, can you bend your chin to your chest?",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Like this? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your neck moves freely, with no stiffness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm quite supple, you know. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And follow my finger. Your pupils are equal and react normally."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any weakness, numbness or trouble speaking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not at all, my speech is fine, and my arms and legs are normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Here is my thinking. Headaches and flushing within minutes of a nitrate spray is a well-known side effect. I think the headache is a side effect of the spray."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Does he have to stop it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not without a plan. Chest tightness needs a medicine to treat it. I'd like to arrange an ECG to look at your heart today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Today? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, it takes five minutes. And I'd like to fit a 24-hour blood pressure monitor, to see what happens to your pressure around the spray."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "I'll bring him to the nurse. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "In the meantime, sit down before you use the spray, and have a sip of water."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Very sensible. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the headaches don't settle in two weeks, come back and we'll look at the options."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Two weeks. We'll book it. ~"
  }
